                            <p class="resources__description">Find the support you need to achieve your goals. BCC offers a wide range of resources and services designed to help students stay connected, overcome challenges, and succeed from enrollment through graduation and beyond.</p>
                            <div class="btn btn--outline-dark">
                <a href="https://brunswickcc.edu/resources/" class="btn">EXPLORE RESOURCES</a>
            </div>
            </div>
</section>


