<p class="wp-block-paragraph">STUDENT STORY</p>



<h2 id="h-ann-faircloth" class="wp-block-heading">Ann Faircloth</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Ann enrolled at BCC to complete her Associate Degree in Early Childhood Education. Twenty-two years after she first began her college journey, Ann graduated from BCC, ready to continue her work in the classroom and expand her impact.</p>



