                                <button class="pf2-option" data-value="int-trade">Learning a Trade</button>
                                <button class="pf2-option" data-value="int-mfg">Working in Manufacturing or Construction</button>
                                <button class="pf2-option" data-value="int-ged">Earning My GED®</button>
                                <button class="pf2-option" data-value="int-span">Courses Taught in Spanish</button>
                                <button class="pf2-option" data-value="int-unsure">I’m Not Sure Yet</button>
                                                </div>
                                <div class="pf2-navigation btn btn--outline-white">
                                                                            <button class="pf2-prev-btn" data-step="2">PREVIOUS</button>
                                                                        <button class="pf2-continue-btn" data-step="2">NEXT</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                                                    <div class="pf2-step" id="pf2-step3">
                                <div class="pf2-step-header">
                                    <h2>WHAT CREDENTIAL ARE YOU HOPING TO EARN?</h2>
                                </div>
                                <div class="pf2-options btn btn--outline-white" id="pf2-pf2-credential-options">
                                                    <div class="pf2-credential-option-wrapper">
                    <button class="pf2-option" data-value="cred-deg">Degree</button>
                                            <div class="pf2-credential-tooltip">In about two years, you can earn an Associate of Arts, Associate of Science, or an Associate of Applied Science degree. Many students continue their education at a four-year college or university.</div>
                                    </div>
                                <div class="pf2-credential-option-wrapper">
                    <button class="pf2-option" data-value="cred-dip">Diploma</button>
                                            <div class="pf2-credential-tooltip">A diploma takes less time (9-18 months) than a degree and provides you with hands-on training and skills in a specific field. You are workforce ready.</div>
                                    </div>
                                <div class="pf2-credential-option-wrapper">
                    <button class="pf2-option" data-value="cred-cert">Certificate</button>
                                            <div class="pf2-credential-tooltip"> If you want focused training in a specific skill or industry in less than one year, a certificate program may be for you.</div>
                                    </div>
                                <div class="pf2-credential-option-wrapper">
                    <button class="pf2-option" data-value="cred-ind">Industry Credential</button>
                                            <div class="pf2-credential-tooltip">In less than six months, you train for employment in a specific field or career type, short-term industry training programs are a great place to start. Some programs offer industry recognized credentials.</div>
                                    </div>
                                <div class="pf2-credential-option-wrapper">
                    <button class="pf2-option" data-value="cred-de">Dual Enrollment Credit</button>
                                            <div class="pf2-credential-tooltip">High School students can accelerate the completion of college certificates, diplomas, and associate degrees.</div>
                                    </div>
                                <div class="pf2-credential-option-wrapper">
                    <button class="pf2-option" data-value="cred-ahs">Adult High School Diploma</button>
                                            <div class="pf2-credential-tooltip">Complete a high school credential (GED®) that mirrors a public-school credential.</div>
                                    </div>
                                <div class="pf2-credential-option-wrapper">
                    <button class="pf2-option" data-value="cred-hse">High School Equivalency</button>
                                            <div class="pf2-credential-tooltip">Prepares adults to take the High School Equivalency Test.</div>
                                    </div>
                                <div class="pf2-credential-option-wrapper">
                    <button class="pf2-option" data-value="cred-np">I’m Not Sure Yet</button>
                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                <div class="pf2-navigation btn btn--outline-white">
                                                                            <button class="pf2-prev-btn" data-step="3">PREVIOUS</button>
                                                                        <button class="pf2-continue-btn" data-step="3">NEXT</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                                                    <div class="pf2-step" id="pf2-step4">
                                <div class="pf2-step-header">
                                    <h2>HOW WOULD YOU PREFER TO LEARN?</h2>
                                </div>
                                <div class="pf2-options btn btn--outline-white" id="pf2-pf2-format-options">
                                                    <button class="pf2-option" data-value="in-person">In Person</button>
                                <button class="pf2-option" data-value="online">Online</button>
                                <button class="pf2-option" data-value="hybrid">Hybrid</button>
                                <button class="pf2-option" data-value="no-preference">No Preference</button>
                                                </div>
                                <div class="pf2-navigation btn btn--outline-white">
                                                                            <button class="pf2-prev-btn" data-step="4">PREVIOUS</button>
                                                                        <button class="pf2-continue-btn" data-step="4">NEXT</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                                                    <div class="pf2-step" id="pf2-step5">
                                <div class="pf2-step-header">
                                    <h2>WHEN WOULD YOU LIKE TO COMPLETE YOUR PROGRAM?</h2>
                                </div>
                                <div class="pf2-options btn btn--outline-white" id="pf2-pf2-timeframe-options">
                                                    <button class="pf2-option" data-value="time-u6">Less than 6 months</button>
                                <button class="pf2-option" data-value="time-6-12">6–12 months</button>
                                <button class="pf2-option" data-value="time-1-2">1–2 years</button>
                                <button class="pf2-option" data-value="time-2p">2+ years</button>
                                <button class="pf2-option" data-value="time-np">I’m Not Sure Yet</button>
                                                </div>
                                <div class="pf2-navigation btn btn--outline-white">
                                                                            <button class="pf2-prev-btn" data-step="5">PREVIOUS</button>
                                                                        <button class="pf2-continue-btn" data-step="5">NEXT</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                                                <div class="pf2-step" id="pf2-step6">
                            <div class="pf2-step-header">
                                <h2>BASED ON YOUR RESPONSES, THESE PROGRAMS MAY BE A GREAT FIT FOR YOU.</h2>
                                <p class="pf2-result-text">Every student&#039;s path is different. Explore these recommended programs to learn more about the opportunities available at Brunswick Community College.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="pf2-results" id="pf2-recommended-programs">
                                <!-- Results will be loaded here -->
                            </div>
                            <div class="pf2-results-actions btn btn--fill-light" style="display: none;">
                                <button class="pf2-email-results-btn">EMAIL RESULTS</button>
                            </div>
                            <div class="pf2-explore-all btn btn--outline-white">
                                <a href="https://brunswickcc.edu/programs/">EXPLORE ALL PROGRAMS</a>
                            </div>
                            <div class="pf2-navigation btn btn--outline-white">
                                <button class="pf2-prev-btn" data-step="6">PREVIOUS</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pf2-progress-bar">
                                                    <div class="pf2-progress-step active" data-step="1"></div>
                                                    <div class="pf2-progress-step" data-step="2"></div>
                                                    <div class="pf2-progress-step" data-step="3"></div>
                                                    <div class="pf2-progress-step" data-step="4"></div>
                                                    <div class="pf2-progress-step" data-step="5"></div>
                                                    <div class="pf2-progress-step" data-step="6"></div>
                                            </div>
                </div>
                <div class="pf2-step-content wizard-form-wrapper pf2-step" id="pf2-step-wizard-form">
                    <div class="pf2-step-content-wrapper">
                        <div class="left-wrapper">
    <div class="pf2-content-inner">
        <h2>Find your pathways and take the next step forward</h2>
        <p>
            Wherever you’re starting, we’re here to help you take the next step.
        </p>
        <p>
            <strong>Pathways Wizard</strong> is your personal academic navigator—helping you map out the right path
            to reach your goals and turn confusion into a clear plan forward.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="right-wrapper">
    <div class="pf2-details-form">
        <label for="pf2-fullname" class="sr-only">Full Name</label>
        <input type="text" id="pf2-fullname" name="fullname" placeholder="Full Name" required>
        <label for="pf2-email-result" class="sr-only">Email</label>
        <input type="email" id="pf2-email-result" name="email" placeholder="Email" autocomplete="email" required>
        <label class="pf2-gdpr-consent">
            <input type="checkbox" id="pf2-gdpr-consent" name="gdpr_consent" required>
            I agree to BCC holding information about me in accordance with its <a href="https://brunswickcc.edu/privacy-policy-cookies/"
                target="_blank">privacy policy.</a>.
        </label>
        <div class="wp-block-button btn btn--outline-white">
            <button class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button pf2-btn-submit-result">
                Email me my result
                <i id="pf2-fav-spinner" style="display: none;" class="fa fa-spinner fa-spin"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
